    renders the inner content when presented and EmptyView() when gated, splitting the web's
    single `null` into the four diagnostic causes useAiEnabled short-circuits on:
    unregistered / settingsUnresolved (== the generic "loading": hidden until settings load) /
    modeOff / featureDisabled. The generic empty/error/stale/offline leaf states are N/A for a
    pure visibility gate (no data feed of its own) and collapse to the fail-closed gated outcome,
    exactly as useAiEnabled documents ("any other state ... yields false"). Mapping is spelled
    out in withAiFeature.swift and exercised by 6 #Preview states.
